-
-### GENERIC_X64 Core systemd architecture fixes
-### Addresses systemd/D-Bus incompatibility issues fundamental to ROCKNIX
-
-echo "Applying core systemd fixes for GENERIC_X64..."
-
-# Fix 1: Disable problematic D-Bus dependent services entirely
-mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system
-
